        <content verticalAlign="middle" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="14" paddingRight="14" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" textAlign="left" autoFit="shape-auto-fit">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">舵机不看占空比，只看脉宽：0.5 到 2.5 毫秒，对应 0 到 180 度。</span></p>
        </content>
